WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
Is there a rapper as&nbsp;
multitalented as Missy Elliott?

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.380
In 2019, Missy Elliott became&nbsp;
only the third rapper to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.480
inducted into the songwriters hall of fame.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.820
Besides her own chart-toppers, she’s written&nbsp;
for Aaliyah, Mariah Carey, and Beyoncé

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.300
In 2019, she was honored with the Video Vanguard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.260
award at the VMAs for her legacy&nbsp;
of culture-shifting music videos.

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.100
Let’s not forget Missy Elliott&nbsp;
the dancer. While some rappers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.280
are still in their performances, she’s&nbsp;
leading the dance line from the front.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.840
It’s Missy Elliott’s originality&nbsp;
and diverse talents that have made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.540
her so influential on a new generation of rappers.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:41.340
You can especially see the Missy influence in&nbsp;
artists like Tierra Whack who’s unique rap flows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:44.400
and mind bending music videos&nbsp;
have earned her critical acclaim.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:49.200
In 2015, Tierra Whack tweeted “Missy&nbsp;
Elliott is my biggest influence!”

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.460
To which Missy responded “much love to&nbsp;
u Tierra Whack, I’m happy to be your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:55.920
biggest influence, makes me proud following u.”

